# =============================================================================
#  LOCAL-ONLY WORKING FILES  —  never pushed to origin
# =============================================================================
# The spec docs, the agent instruction file, the push checklist, and the
# legacy clone are all working material. README.md is the ONLY markdown file
# that belongs in the repository.

docs/
legacy/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
PUSH-CHECKLIST.md
WORKING-CONTEXT.md
DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md
*.local.md
.plan/
.ecc/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Ignore README.md anywhere EXCEPT the repo root. Scaffolders (create-vite,
# django-admin, etc.) regenerate nested README.md files; without this they'd
# ship untracked, silently violating "README.md is the only markdown file
# that belongs in the repository."
**/README.md
!/README.md

